# External checkouts and local dumps (fetched or produced on demand, never project source)
# Vendored SDK dumps.
ultralight-free-sdk-*/
# Conversion-tool checkouts (cloned by FX/tools/convert-fx-source1.ps1 setup).
Misc/source1import/
Misc/Source2Converter/
# Generated CS2 offset reference dumps.
Misc/cs2-offsets/source/
Misc/cs2-offsets/cs2-offsets-*.csv
Misc/cs2-offsets/cs2-offsets-meta.json
Misc/cs2-offsets/cs2-offsets-update.log
