Misc/cs2-offsets/.update-stage-*/
# Local dev reference dumps (Panorama layout, third-party mod/source references).
reference/
# Local third-party RE tools and dumps (~1 GB).
/.codex/
# NVIDIA DLSS 5 + Streamline runtime payload: the local source the optional installer copies into
# the private SOURCE:MVM CS2 binary folder. Named subfolders preserve the NVIDIA original and the
# supplied RTX 40, 30, 20 compatible patched variant; hashes are tracked in payload-versions.json.
/dlss 5/
# DLSS 5 bridge experiment scratch: netcon transcripts and probe dumps.
/artifacts/
/Docs/handoff/
/Docs/deadlock/handoff-deadlock/
/Misc/design_handoff_config_camera_editor_rail/
/Misc/design_handoff_customize_deathanims/
/Docs/effects/HANDOFF-sky-rotation.md
/Docs/effects/lighting-experiment-handoff.md

