# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Accidental root-level artifacts. Debug logs belong in %APPDATA%\HLAE\debuglogs\. Tools run from
# the repo instead of the user profile have written here, and raw netcon/console output has landed
# as files named after the command itself (`demo_pause`, `mirv_filmmaker follow status`) or a JS
# fragment (`dbgGeom)`). A pattern cannot catch every future name, but these never are sources.
/*.log
/*.ppm
/nul
/AppData/
/demo_pause
/mirv_filmmaker*
/*)
/exceptions.txt
/demo_*
/spec_*
/mvm_test*
/mvmsb_*
mvm_debug_*.log
# Resource-compiler search output; runtime FX is staged under build/, never at the root.
/particles/

# The bug report webhook (Discord) stays out of the public repository: see
# Docs/features/filmmaker_community.md.
AfxHookSource2/Filmmaker/Community/BugReportWebhook.local.h
# The read-only bot that fetches those reports back (Automation/tools/discord-reports.py).
Automation/config/discord-reports.local.json

# Local trailer production files and captured media.
/trailer/
# Local build transcript.
/Automation/rabins-log.txt

# Local credentials, signing material and private settings. Defense in depth next to the explicit
