*.dmp
*.mdmp
*.etl
*.har
*.pcap
*.pcapng
/security-reports/
/sensitive-data-removal/
/release-private/
/Automation/reports-private/

# Third-party game material: the donor FX and animations, the FX pack compiled from them and the
# baked death-animation library. They ship in SOURCE:MVM releases but are not part of the source
# (FX/README.md). Kept privately and placed here locally for development and packaging.
/FX/sources/
/FX/compiled/
/FX/death-animations/

# Third-party media that is not ours to redistribute in the source tree. The osu! beatmaps and songs
# are other people's (and commercial artists') work; the launcher fonts are Valve's Stratum2 and the
# sound is from CS2; the UwU egg's song is someone else's music. They stay on the developer's
# machine and are still bundled into releases from there. The osu! SKIN (Assets/easter-eggs/osu-skin)
# is a public skin and stays tracked, and so does our own generated warmup map
# (Automation/tools/make-osu-warmup-map.py).
/Assets/easter-eggs/osu/*
!/Assets/easter-eggs/osu/SOURCE MVM - Warmup/
/Assets/easter-eggs/uwu/music.mp3
/SourceMovieMakerLauncher/public/fonts/
/SourceMovieMakerLauncher/public/sounds/
/SourceMovieMakerLauncher/public/panorama/

/Docs/setup/publication-readiness.md
